{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/thm-descartes","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Theorem","doco:Section"],"label":"thm:descartes","kind":"theorem","title":"Descartes theorem","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-brings-is-qou","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-genus-maximal-descent"],"proofs":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prf-descartes"],"tags":["archimedean-universe","terminal-object","brings-surface"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.Archimedean.descartes","text":"descartes.md","leanSource":"descartes.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"thm:descartes\"></a><p>Let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathbf{C}_{-6}</code> denote the category of quantum observable universes over <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">R</code> at a fixed value of the substrate parameter <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q</code> satisfying the Descartes condition <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\chi_{\\mathrm{eu}}(M_0) = -6</code>, with morphisms given by QOU maps that preserve the Euler characteristic. Bring's surface <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\Sigma_4</code> is a terminal object in <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathbf{C}_{-6}</code>: for every Descartes universe <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">(\\mathbf{C}, A, \\tau)</code> in <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathbf{C}_{-6}</code>, there exists a unique morphism to the Bring's QOU.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/descartes.md","heading":"Theorem","number":"8.14.1","page":"b/thm-descartes","qa":{"counts":{"pass":91,"fail":1,"warn":0,"na":12,"unknown":0,"stale":79},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":0}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.MassTheory.Archimedean.descartes","via":"sibling","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/descartes.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
